Bug 2048221 - Better StartupCache locking. r=jesup
Serialize disk writes with mIOLock, and keep mTableLock just about
mTable. Make the entries refcounted so they're snapshottable and move
the offsets that we mutate while writing outside since we only use them
during a single write.

